From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000005 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ParadoxUI <noreply@localhost>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 16:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Move ApplicationPackageManager to a secondary DEX

The stock framework.jar classes.dex method table is already at the hard
65536 entry limit, so the Google Photos hook introduced by
0001-Allow-unlimited-storage-for-Google-Photos adds new method references
that overflow it and abort the smali build. Relocate the patched class to
classes7.dex, which has plenty of free method slots.

---
 smali/android/app/ApplicationPackageManager.smali | 0
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

diff --git a/smali/android/app/ApplicationPackageManager.smali b/smali_classes7/android/app/ApplicationPackageManager.smali
similarity index 100%
rename from smali/android/app/ApplicationPackageManager.smali
rename to smali_classes7/android/app/ApplicationPackageManager.smali
-- 
